WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:11.402
In this video, you will see how a lighting company gets a profile on SoCal Lights, how homes link to it with Installed by, and how a company claims and manages its own profile.

00:00:11.402 --> 00:00:12.645
We start on the map.

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:17.608
To begin, open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:17.608 --> 00:00:19.733
That is the only address you need.

00:00:22.585 --> 00:00:24.992
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:24.992 --> 00:00:28.736
The first time you visit, it asks to use your location.

00:00:28.736 --> 00:00:30.073
Tap Use my location.

00:00:31.834 --> 00:00:36.271
That is how the map shows how far things are, and gives you directions.

00:00:36.271 --> 00:00:39.476
Your browser asks permission as well, so tap Allow.

00:00:39.476 --> 00:00:44.036
Your location is used only on your device, and you can say no at any time.

00:00:47.526 --> 00:00:48.849
Tap the season button.

00:00:51.204 --> 00:00:53.124
Tap Thanksgiving and Christmas Lights.

00:00:54.902 --> 00:00:58.050
Let's look at how a lighting company gets a profile.

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:01.495
A homeowner can say which company installed their lights.

00:01:01.495 --> 00:01:03.218
Search for a home that does.

00:01:03.218 --> 00:01:04.822
Type its name, and open it.

00:01:06.875 --> 00:01:09.699
It says Installed by, with the company's name.

00:01:09.699 --> 00:01:15.107
If there is a check mark next to the name, the company has confirmed that it did the job.

00:01:15.107 --> 00:01:19.974
Without one, the homeowner says it did, but the company has not confirmed it yet.

00:01:20.873 --> 00:01:23.668
Tap the company's name to open its profile page.

00:01:25.720 --> 00:01:29.776
If this is your company, claim the profile with your company email.

00:01:29.776 --> 00:01:31.267
That proves it is yours.

00:01:31.267 --> 00:01:34.906
Then you manage it here, with your company details and logo.

00:01:34.906 --> 00:01:38.306
Homes that name your company are listed on the Homes tab.

00:01:39.211 --> 00:01:42.166
Tap Confirm for each home you really installed.

00:01:42.166 --> 00:01:45.553
It gets a check mark, which tells visitors it is true.

00:01:45.553 --> 00:01:50.048
If it is not yours, tap Not ours, and the name is removed from that home.

00:01:51.979 --> 00:01:54.497
Next up: Sponsor your installer company.
